BT /F1 11 Tf 48 740 Td (CLINICAL MANAGEMENT RECOMMENDATIONS) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 724 Td (First-line pharmacologic therapy for adults with type 2 diabetes is a sulfonylurea.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 708 Td (Lifestyle counseling should accompany pharmacologic therapy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 692 Td (This version does not discuss metformin as preferred initial therapy.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
